1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
kalpana kijiye, ek aisa prani

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,395
jisaki sans mein jahar hai,

3
00:00:03,395 --> 00:00:05,156
jisaka sparsh mrityu hai, jisaki

4
00:00:05,156 --> 00:00:07,273
aankhon mein samucha brahmand samaya

5
00:00:07,273 --> 00:00:08,894
hai. aur phir kalpana kijiye

6
00:00:08,894 --> 00:00:10,040
ki us prani ko khud

7
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:11,690
mahadev ne apne gale mein

8
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:12,454
dharan kiya.

9
00:00:12,924 --> 00:00:14,648
kyun? kyunki woh koee sadharan

10
00:00:14,648 --> 00:00:15,799
sarp nahi tha. woh tha

11
00:00:15,799 --> 00:00:17,174
vasuki, nagon ka raja.

12
00:00:17,644 --> 00:00:18,814
woh sarp jisane ek bar

13
00:00:18,814 --> 00:00:20,261
apna pura sharir rassi ki

14
00:00:20,261 --> 00:00:21,809
tarah de diya, taki devata

15
00:00:21,809 --> 00:00:23,222
aur asur milakar srishti ko

16
00:00:23,222 --> 00:00:23,824
bacha sake.

17
00:00:24,294 --> 00:00:26,024
woh raja jisane asahaniy dard

18
00:00:26,024 --> 00:00:27,403
mein bhi munh nahi khola.

19
00:00:27,403 --> 00:00:28,790
woh bhakt jisake bare mein

20
00:00:28,790 --> 00:00:30,429
khud bhagavan krishn ne gita

21
00:00:30,429 --> 00:00:31,752
mein kaha, sarpon mein main

22
00:00:31,752 --> 00:00:32,423
vasuki hun.
